@morewax/dsh-remote-exec README · Install：```sh
dsh plugin --profile default add github:moreWax/dsh-remote-exec
```

@morewax/dsh-remote-exec README · live end-to-end over ssh (needs key auth to the target):：DSH_REMOTE_LIVE=1 DSH_REMOTE_HOST=127.0.0.1 DSH_REMOTE_USER=$USER \
DSH_REMOTE_ROOT=/tmp/remote-test pnpm test
```

@morewax/dsh-remote-exec README · Status：Built against DeepSeek Harness `0.1.1-rc.x` (developer preview). Remote shell
and filesystem are verified end-to-end over SSH; mosh interactive uses the
standard `mosh` client behavior.
